subject_definitions:
@image1 is Rourke, the man in the black tuxedo; he is ordinary human size.
@image3 and @image5 is the Titan, an eight-metre armoured giant.
@image2 is the VX-07 armour that assembles onto Rourke; it is the only source for the armour, and its printed labels and grey backdrop are not part of the scene.
@image4 is the location: a cracked grey plain under two vast stone arches, a burning city and snow mountains beyond, clear daylight.

summary: A man in a tuxedo stands his ground on a burning plain as a giant advances, and a suit of armour assembles onto his body plate by plate.

detailed_description: Summer blockbuster superhero film, anamorphic, heavy dust and fire haze.
[Shot 1] Rourke stands facing camera in the middle of the cracked plain from @image4, the Titan from @image3 advancing far behind him and growing steadily larger, the camera locked off at chest height. The VX-07 plates from @image2 come in low and fast across the ground from every side and lock onto him — shins, thighs, chest, shoulders, forearms — everything travelling inward toward his centre, nothing detaching and nothing floating free. The assembly runs continuously across almost the whole video, never rushing and never springing back, the helmet closing over his face last and its eye slits lighting. Rourke's lips stay pressed closed for the entire shot and he does not speak at any point in the video. Fire, smoke and blowing grey dust move through the frame throughout. No on-screen text, subtitles or watermarks.

overall_soundscape: Continuous wind across open ground with fire crackling and debris ticking nearby. Heavy plates ring and clack as they strike and lock, building into a dense mechanical rhythm that runs the length of the video and ends with the helmet sealing and servos settling. Deep footfalls from the advancing giant grow louder underneath, and grit hisses across stone in the gaps. No voices anywhere in the video.

non_diegetic_music: Orchestral brass and low strings over a driving percussion pulse, sparse at the start and building steadily to a full hit as the helmet closes.

subject_definitions:
@image2 is the Titan, an eight-metre armoured giant.
@image3 is the VX-07 armour Rourke is wearing; the round ports on its shoulders and knees are thrusters and weapon emitters.
@image4 is the location: a cracked grey plain under two vast stone arches, a burning city and snow mountains beyond, clear daylight.
@video1 is the previous clip; it sets Rourke's armoured look, the grade and the light.

summary: The armoured man spins to face the giant behind him, launches into its chest and blasts it into one of the great stone arches.

detailed_description: Summer blockbuster superhero film, anamorphic, heavy dust and fire haze. One continuous unbroken take with no cuts at any point.
[Shot 1] Rourke, in the VX-07 armour from @image3, fills the frame in close-up, facing camera, the Titan from @image2 behind him. He snaps his head and shoulders around hard to his left and turns his whole body to face it; the camera whips around him with the turn, staying tight on his helmet the whole way, and the Titan comes into frame as he completes it. The camera keeps travelling in the same direction and falls back and low as he moves, ending side-on to the pair; it never stops moving and is still travelling at the last frame. The knee and shoulder ports fire and Rourke launches off the ground into the Titan's chest hard enough to lift it, then both palm emitters throw a thick rope of white-blue electrical plasma up into it — the plasma leaves his hands, crosses the gap and stays on the Titan, washing over its torso and hiding it completely, driving it backwards into the base of the near arch. The stone shatters where it lands and a whole section of the arch breaks away and drops. Every impact throws grey concrete dust up and outward that hangs and does not clear, and the ground splits in a line running away from each footfall. Rourke advances after it the entire video and never gives ground. His helmet stays closed over his face throughout. No on-screen text, subtitles or watermarks.

overall_soundscape: Wind and burning debris under everything. Servos snap as he turns, thruster ignition cracks and roars, and the energy weapon builds to a sustained electrical roar that crackles against metal. Huge metal-on-metal impacts, stone splitting and grinding as the arch section comes down, rubble settling and dust hissing in the gaps. No voices anywhere in the video.

non_diegetic_music: Full orchestral brass and pounding low percussion at a fast driving tempo, sustained throughout with hard accents on the turn, the launch and the collapse.

subject_definitions:
@image2 is the Titan, an eight-metre armoured giant.
@image3 is the VX-07 armour Rourke is wearing; the round ports on its shoulders and knees are thrusters and weapon emitters.
@image4 is the location: a cracked grey plain under two vast stone arches, a burning city and snow mountains beyond, clear daylight.

summary: The giant charges and drives the armoured man down into the ground, blowing out a crater; his armour holds but comes away scarred.

detailed_description: Summer blockbuster superhero film, anamorphic, heavy dust and fire haze. One continuous unbroken take with no cuts at any point.
[Shot 1] Rourke, in the VX-07 armour from @image3, faces the Titan from @image2 across the cracked ground of @image4. From the first frame the camera is already moving: it drives forward low and fast behind Rourke and keeps going the whole video, dropping as it travels until it is down at ground level, and it is still moving at the last frame. The Titan charges him at full speed, closes the gap in a few strides and brings both fists down onto him together. Rourke gets his forearms up and the armour holds — it does not break — but the blow drives him straight down and the ground gives way instead: the stone caves in around him and a crater opens outward, slabs tilting up on end, the burning crack in the ground splitting wider and running away across the plain, and a heavy body of grey dust rolling outward from the impact low across the ground and hiding the rim. The Titan hammers down onto him again inside the crater and the floor drops further each time. Rourke is on one knee at the bottom in the settling dust, his armour scarred and dented down one side with a shoulder plate torn loose and one emitter gone dark, and he plants a hand and pushes back up to standing as the video ends. His helmet stays closed over his face throughout. No on-screen text, subtitles or watermarks.

overall_soundscape: Wind and burning debris under everything. The giant's charging footfalls build fast and heavy into a colossal metal-on-metal impact, followed by stone splitting, slabs grinding and grating as they tilt, and rubble raining down and settling. Servos strain and whine under the weight, dust hisses across broken ground, and a second and third impact land inside it. No voices anywhere in the video.

non_diegetic_music: Full orchestral brass and low percussion, driving hard through the charge to a single enormous hit on the impact, then dropping away to low sustained strings under the dust as he rises.

